  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.teykros.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.teykros.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_teykros"><head>ΤΕΥΚΡΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="506" xml:id="fragment-teykros-dindorf1893_grc1-506" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_teykros" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.teykros.nauck1889grc1:521">
            <note type="source">Stephanus</note>
            <quote>Κυχρεῖος· πάγος περὶ Σαλαμῖνα. Σοφοκλῆς Τεύκρῳ.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="507" xml:id="fragment-teykros-dindorf1893_grc1-507" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_teykros" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.teykros.nauck1889grc1:520">
            <note type="source">Aristophanes Nubibus 583.</note>
            <quote>Βροντὴ δ᾽ ἐρράγη δι᾽ ἀστραπῆς.</quote>
            <note>ubi scholiasta, παρὰ τὰ ἐκ Τεύκρου Σοφοκλέους</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐρανοῦ δ᾽ ἄπο</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἤστραψε, βροντὴ δ᾽ ἐρράγη δι᾽ ἀστραπῆς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="508" xml:id="fragment-teykros-dindorf1893_grc1-508" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_teykros" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.teykros.nauck1889grc1:519">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CXXII, 10.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὡς ἄρ᾽, ὦ τέκνον, κενὴν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἐτερπόμην σου τέρψιν εὐλογουμένου,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ὡς ζῶντος· ἡ δ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ἐν σκότῳ λαθοῦσά με</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">ἔσαιν᾽ Ἐρινὺς ἡδοναῖς ἐψευσμένον.</l>
            </lg>
            <note>Ad hanc fabulam Blomfildus refert versus ab Tryphone de tropis p. 48. sine poetæ nomine allatos.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
